  "slug": "cranberry-hootycreeks",
  "name": "Cranberry Hootycreeks",
  "recipe_type": "dessert",
  "brief_description": "This festive cookie in a jar recipe layers flour, oats, sugar, dried cranberries, white chocolate chips, and pecans to make a great holiday gift.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Layer ingredients in a 1-quart (1-liter) jar in the following order, pressing each layer down gently before adding the next: \u215d cup all-purpose flour, rolled oats, \u00bd cup all-purpose flour, baking soda, salt, brown sugar, white sugar, dried cranberries, white chocolate chips, and chopped pecans. Seal jar tightly. Attach a card with the baking instructions below."
    }
  ],
